{
  "note": "The routing bench (route_eval_test.go): signals, a note and the user's settings and rule, and where it must go. A target is step:device, or the step alone (telegram). Devices: mac (Mac · Chrome), pc (Windows · Edge), iphone (iPhone · Safari · app), ipad (iPad · Safari). Default settings: the default order, voice off, 10 minutes.",
